# Go conventions

- Layout: `cmd/{server,agent,shardman}`, `internal/{bucket,fsm,store,resolve,grpcapi,seal,retention,metrics,topology}`, `pkg/client`, `api/proto`.
- Domain logic in `internal/bucket` and `internal/fsm` — no grpc/pgx imports there.
- API: gRPC + protobuf; ops HTTP only (`/healthz`, `/metrics`).
- DB: pgx; logs: slog; metrics: Prometheus client; optional OTel OTLP.
- Config via env (`METADATA_PG_DSN`, `GRPC_ADDR`, `HTTP_ADDR`, `CLUSTER_KEY`, `SEAL_CHECK_INTERVAL`, `DRAIN_TIMEOUT`).
- Admin/internal auth: `x-cluster-key` gRPC metadata.
- Integration tests: build tag `integration`, env `METADATA_PG_DSN`.
- E2E tests: build tag `e2e`, testcontainers.
